        "AbstractText": "Measuring outcomes for educational programs can be challenging for many nursing professional development (NPD) practitioners. Alignment of goals with outcomes provides the foundation for the educator to justify, evaluate, and improve programs with more efficiency. This article highlights lessons learned by NPD practitioners after successful justification for continued support of educational programs. J Contin Nurs Educ. 2017;48(12):537-538."
